itsm env: leave an unset URL out of the step env, so the Tasks stop drifting in Argo CD (#143)

An env entry with value "" is stored by the API server without its value
(omitempty), so Argo CD diffed itsm-gate, itsm-change and open-release-pr
against the chart forever: every sync succeeded and the Tasks stayed
OutOfSync (hangar-dev, webhook provider, ITSM_SERVICENOW_URL). The helper
now emits ITSM_SERVICENOW_URL / ITSM_WEBHOOK_URL only when set, and
itsm.sh defaults both to empty under set -u. Rendered for none, webhook
and servicenow; itsm_test.sh and gate_required_test.sh pass.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>